                            "Stable, fully-qualified test ID — opaque to the UI, but the\nshape is contract-stable per language so the server can\ntranslate it back to the right CLI invocation:\n\n  - \*\*csharp\*\* — `Namespace.ClassName.MethodName`\n    (e.g. `Memento.Tests.Login.LoginSuite.HappyPath`).\n    Parameterized `[TestCase]`s collapse into the parent\n    method id; running it runs every case.\n  - \*\*python\*\* — pytest node id:\n    `relative\/path\/to\/file.py::ClassName::test_method`\n    (`ClassName::` omitted for module-level functions).\n  - \*\*nodejs\*\* — Playwright human-readable id:\n    `relative\/path\/to\/file.spec.ts > describe title > test title`\n    (` > ` separator). Nested describes chain with the same\n    separator. Used as the `--grep` regex source after\n    escaping.\n  - \*\*java\*\* — `com.pkg.ClassName#methodName`.\n",
